{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/extras/Leonardo_Phoenix_10_A_striking_logo_for_the_game_Zombie_Maraud_0__1_.jpg?t=1743094358\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombie Marauders is a minimalistic zombie time survival game with idle game mechanics. The zombies are all kinds of vicious and some even have magical powers. As the lone survivor, you have an arsenal of weapons to rip through hell's worst and make humanity's last stand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/extras/Default_A_dramatic_highcontrast_image_featuring_a_bold_distres_2_8d9c4be6-fa5c-4dec-b5b5-2eee5f622145_0.png?t=1743094358\" />Starting with a simple pistol, kill zombies to earn money, and unlock weapons and weapon upgrades. Try to survive as long as you can. Earn XP to level up faster in subsequent attempts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Starting Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Don't stay still. They will be on you from all directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Prioritize faster and stronger enemies to earn more money and XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. You earn XP when you kill enemies. So, go on the offense instead of playing defensively to level up faster.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507030?t=1743094358","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743094358","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/5738386d807f7e426c9f15bef20df1a81b037b7a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743094358","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/5738386d807f7e426c9f15bef20df1a81b037b7a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743094358","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/extras/Leonardo_Phoenix_10_A_striking_logo_for_the_game_Zombie_Maraud_0__1_.jpg?t=1743094358\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Zombie Marauders is a minimalistic zombie time survival game with idle game mechanics. The zombies are all kinds of vicious and some even have magical powers. As the lone survivor, you have an arsenal of weapons to rip through hell's worst and make humanity's last stand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/extras/Default_A_dramatic_highcontrast_image_featuring_a_bold_distres_2_8d9c4be6-fa5c-4dec-b5b5-2eee5f622145_0.png?t=1743094358\" />Starting with a simple pistol, kill zombies to earn money, and unlock weapons and weapon upgrades. Try to survive as long as you can. Earn XP to level up faster in subsequent attempts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Starting Tips</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1. Don't stay still. They will be on you from all directions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2. Prioritize faster and stronger enemies to earn more money and XP.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3. You earn XP when you kill enemies. So, go on the offense instead of playing defensively to level up faster.</p>","developers":["Bhelpuri Boyz"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507030/header.jpg?t=1743094358","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirement